Package: tuesday-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, ca-certificates, chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable | firefox
Recommends: curl, zenity
Maintainer: TUESDAY Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: Secure lightweight desktop client for TUESDAY
 Launches the configured HTTPS TUESDAY backend as a desktop application using
 the user's maintained system browser. Credentials remain in HttpOnly cookies.
